#Step 4  Web Wrangling to clean up the missing or coded data
...wranglign data using API:

    Use of APIs to target other endpoints to gather data about ID numbers that store data in separate lists, to be used to create dataframes
    --> columns with unknown IDs: rocket, payloads, launchpad, and cores
    --> APIs provided:

    API              Purposes                                                    Syntax
    ---              --------                                                    -------
    Booster          Returns Booster Name                                        getBoosterVersion(data)
    Launchpad        Returns Name of Launch Site, and its longtitude/latitude    getLaunchSite(data)        
    Payload          Returns Mass of Payload and Orbit to go                     getPayloadData(data)
    Core             Returns a number of insights about the launch               getCoreData(data)

    --> Create empty lists for each expected attributes from these APIs
    --> Call each of these APIs to save data into these separate lists
    --> Combine these lists into a dictionary launch_dict
    --> Convert the dictionary into a dataframe called launch: df = pd.DataFrame(launch_dict)

